_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#batteryLabelSymbolMeaning> "The crossed-out wheelie bin symbol indicates separate collection is required."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#batterySubstancesImpact> "Improper disposal may release electrolyte and heavy metals into soil and water."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#endUserRoleInSeparateCollection> "End users must not dispose of batteries as unsorted municipal waste."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#endUserRoleInWastePrevention> "End users should avoid mechanical damage and follow the usage instructions."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#preparationForRepurposingFacilities> "Authorised facility: Iberia Second-Life Hub, Valencia."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#preparationForReuseFacilities> "Authorised facility: Iberia Reuse Centre, Zaragoza."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#separateCollectionPoints> "https://example.com/collection-points"@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#takeBackCollectionPoints> "Return to any authorised dealer free of charge."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#wasteBatterySafetyInstructions> "Store damaged batteries in a dry, ventilated, non-flammable container."@en-ie .
_:b318_b37 <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#wasteBatteryTreatmentFacilities> "Authorised recycling plant: Recycla Ibérica, Bilbao."@en-ie .
